  "provenance": "Hand-written in this repository for building and testing NS v1 (design P6-D3). No third-party terms; no download.",
  "licence": "The project's own; replaced only by the owner's choice of lexicon (P6-R6).",
  "language": "en",
  "positive": ["gain", "gains", "growth", "grew", "higher", "increase", "increased", "profit", "profits", "record",
